On Mar 27, 2013, at 7:12 AM, Gary King <king-nRXb03v5zC6Vc3sceRu5cw at public.gmane.org> wrote:


CEM will run on very large data sets.  if you turn off the L1 calculation, it will also run very fast.  The results are obviously not the same as the usual application of full matching, but they are related.


